{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, the popular mini-game &quot;Gambling Den&quot; from the 2011 Xbox 360 indie game <i>Ninja Recapture</i> has been released as a standalone game!<br>Bet on which dueling ninja will emerge victorious!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Win, and you get double your wager!<br>Lose, and you lose it all!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with 100 ry\u014d and aim for the maximum of 99,999 ry\u014d!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In multiplayer mode, up to 8 players can compete.<br>There are two game modes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survival Mode</strong><br>A race to see who can reach 99,999 Ry\u014d first.<br>Expect a brutal battle of luck!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Prize King Mode</strong><br>Play a set number of rounds, and the player with the most total winnings wins!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A pure test of luck\u2014no strategy required!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Millionaire!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3501960/cd4dbb5dde344fc30621fd1f7c2d1d9b403be1cc.jpg"},{"name":"Millionaire!2","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3501960/f71beef4ae6253652a8bfebe83e1ea6b01f70ecd.jpg"},{"name":"Prize King","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3501960/d205123519a1c77794a643be91bde23d555f1ced.jpg"},{"name":"Sent to the coal mines!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3501960/6b9b3ed637b99244881402facbe89014b41ff74a.jpg"},{"name":"Sent to the coal mines! 50","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3501960/33ac02937d1c2834b6f5fbe172718417f4c3e485.jpg"},{"name":"Sent to the coal mines! 100","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3501960/f8f39677006d33c331a7da8d3e4f1f38a367b235.jpg"}],"total":6},"background":"ht